# This is a placeholder file. In production, you would generate actual Open Graph images.

For dynamic Open Graph images, consider using:
1. Vercel OG (https://vercel.com/docs/functions/og-image-generation)
2. Puppeteer with a headless browser
3. Services like og-image.vercel.app

Example implementation:
- Create an API route that generates images dynamically based on title/content
- Use HTML/CSS templates with branding
- Cache generated images for performance
